{{Nihongo|'''Watanabe Prefecure'''|渡辺県|Watanabe-ken}} is a prefecture of Nakahara located in island of Maejima. Watanabe prefecture host many cities part of Greater Shinkyo including [[Watanabe]], [[Kashizaki]] and [[Shimazaki, Watanabe|Shimazaki]].